From 7ece9d011f2dcfc0dfe42a4abb887a7420fc4615 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 03:54:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(instruments): glass 3D surfaces for the Skills
 controller and Experience radio

Draw both playable devices with the About section's glass kit (frosted cream
shell, dark rim, cream chassis, dark glass screens, orange-lit pads, brushed
knobs) as a three.js layer behind the live DOM. Layout and state are read from
data-i3d parts and aria/data attributes, so audio, keyboard shortcuts and the
scroll sequence are untouched and the DOM remains the fallback. Radio gains a
playable TUNE dial and speaker.
